{
  "title": "RemoteFM1",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "FM-1 firmwares run",
        "on the Move itself:",
        "three at once, each",
        "in its own slot.",
        "",
        "Play them from the",
        "pads, knobs and the",
        "sequencer.",
        "",
        "A phone or computer",
        "on the same Wi-Fi:",
        "remotefm1.local:7730",
        "shows the FM-1's",
        "screen, Mix & FX,",
        "files and more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Leaving",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + touch the",
        "volume knob + click",
        "the jog wheel.",
        "",
        "Move's own software",
        "starts again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Modes",
      "lines": [
        "Tap a Track button:",
        "Track 1: FM-1",
        "Track 2: MIDI",
        "Track 3: Control",
        "Track 4: Sequencer",
        "",
        "Only a quick tap",
        "switches. Holding a",
        "Track button opens",
        "its menu instead.",
        "",
        "Track 1 held: the",
        "Move's Shift layer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FM-1 Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Playing",
          "lines": [
            "Pads are the FM-1's",
            "keys. Knobs and",
            "buttons are its",
            "knobs and buttons.",
            "Volume is MASTER.",
            "",
            "Up: the FM-1's SEQ",
            "Down: the next",
            " loaded firmware"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Labels",
          "lines": [
            "Touch a knob: its",
            "name and value.",
            "",
            "Hold a button: what",
            "it does now.",
            "",
            "Touch the jog wheel",
            "and press buttons:",
            "each shows its",
            "label at once.",
            "",
            "Popup size: Global",
            "Settings, knob 4."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Firmwares",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "The Firmware View",
          "lines": [
            "Click Back to flip",
            "between the mode",
            "and the firmwares.",
            "",
            "Tracks 1-3: the",
            "three slots.",
            "Track 4: projects.",
            "",
            "Pads pick a firmware",
            "Jog press: load it",
            "Jog turn: its info",
            "Left/Right: banks",
            "Delete: unload"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lists & Filters",
          "lines": [
            "Step 1: Favorites",
            "Step 2: All",
            "Steps 3-7: category",
            "Steps 8-15: tags",
            "Step 16: Fantasy",
            "",
            "Sample: favorite",
            "Knob 1: pad colour"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Update",
          "lines": [
            "Mute: the catalog.",
            "Step 1: updates",
            "Step 2: not",
            " installed",
            "",
            "Jog press downloads",
            "(Wi-Fi), then loads",
            "it into the track."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switching Slots",
          "lines": [
            "Hold Back + tap",
            "Track 1-3: play",
            "that slot.",
            "",
            "Down (FM-1 mode):",
            "the next loaded",
            "slot.",
            "",
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "volume: that slot's",
            "level."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "States",
          "lines": [
            "Loop: the firmware's",
            "saved states.",
            "Pad: load a state",
            "Empty pad: save",
            "Copy + pad: save",
            " over it",
            "Delete + pad: delete",
            "Loop or Back: leave"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX & Mix",
      "lines": [
        "Your Schwung MIDI FX",
        "and audio FX run",
        "inside RemoteFM1.",
        "",
        "In the firmware",
        "view, Menu toggles",
        "FX setup (FX pages",
        "and the Mixer).",
        "",
        "Hold an FX pad and",
        "turn the jog: pick",
        "a module. Jog click:",
        "its pages. Back:",
        "out of the pages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI & Control",
      "lines": [
        "Pads play notes into",
        "the firmware.",
        "",
        "Hold Track 2: top",
        "pads the layout,",
        "steps the channel,",
        "Up/Down the octave.",
        "",
        "Track 2 held + top",
        "row pad 8: latch.",
        "",
        "Control mode: knobs",
        "send CCs. Jog picks",
        "the bank. Hold",
        "Track 3 + turn: the",
        "CC number."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer",
      "lines": [
        "16 tracks, each on",
        "its own MIDI",
        "channel, like Move's",
        "own sequencer.",
        "",
        "Hold Track 4: steps",
        "are the tracks.",
        "Tap: select",
        "Double tap: solo",
        "Hold: mute",
        "",
        "It keeps playing in",
        "every mode.",
        "",
        "Sync: INT by",
        "default."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "An FM-1 as Panel",
      "lines": [
        "Plug an FM-1 running",
        "RemoteFM1 into the",
        "Move's USB-A: its",
        "keys, knobs and LEDs",
        "work. Its screen",
        "shows a plug icon.",
        "",
        "With the Wi-Fi build",
        "on the same Wi-Fi",
        "the Move finds it,",
        "screen and all.",
        "",
        "Set up its Wi-Fi on",
        "the page, or on the",
        "FM-1: hold HOME,",
        "the WI-FI row."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "More",
      "lines": [
        "Guide:",
        "remotefm1.com/move",
        "",
        "Source and issues:",
        "github.com/",
        "Quixotic7/",
        "remoteFM14Move"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
